        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-387 (ensure controlled execution — Retail Media Revenue &amp; Analytics (PA-48.3).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules | ---
Owner: Accounting Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
